%N A051504 Number of asymmetric digraphs with n nodes.
%C A051504 For n = 8..13, the terms were computed by Möbius inversion over the subgroup lattice of S_n, reduced to conjugacy classes using tables of marks. - _Vladeta Jovovic_, Aug 24 2026
%D A051504 F. Harary and E. M. Palmer, Graphical Enumeration, Academic Press, NY, 1973, p. 231.
%D A051504 V. Jovovic, Boolean Functions with Prescribed Automorphism Groups, unpublished manuscript, 1986.
%D A051504 P. K. Stockmeyer, The enumeration of graphs with prescribed automorphism group, Dissertation, Univ. of Michigan, Ann Arbor, 1971.
%H A051504 Vladeta Jovovic, <a href="/A051504/a051504.pdf">Computational Evaluation of A051504</a>.
%H A051504 Vladeta Jovovic, <a href="/A051504/a051504_2.pdf">Symmetry Types of Combinatorial Structures</a>, 2026.
%H A051504 Vladeta Jovovic, <a href="/A051504/a051504_3.pdf">Boolean Functions with Prescribed Automorphism Groups (1986; reconstructed and corrected edition, 2026)</a>.
%F A051504 a(n) = A000273(n) - A067309(n). - _Andrew Howroyd_, Dec 06 2020
%F A051504 a(n) = (1/n!)*Sum_{K <= S_n} mu({1},K)*2^r(K), where r(K) is the number of K-orbits on ordered pairs (i,j), i != j. - _Vladeta Jovovic_, Aug 24 2026
%Y A051504 Cf. A000273 (digraphs), A003400 (asymmetric graphs), A030242 (asymmetric relations), A067309.
